ss="button-text">sign up free</p><div class="button-gradient color"></div></a><a data-nav-link="" data-wf--nav_link--variant="underline" href="/ios-app" class="nav_link w-variant-1dc93b8a-db4c-c809-b928-25ac0d70d36d w-inline-block"><div class="nav_link-text-wrap"><div class="nav_link-text">Download iOS app</div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="div-2"><a data-nav-mobile-only="" data-nav-cta="" href="https://fathom.video/users/sign_up" class="button-top grad menu-btn is-animated w-inline-block"><p class="button-text">SIGN UP for FREE</p></a><a data-nav-mobile-only="" data-nav-toggle="" href="#" class="nav_burger w-inline-block"><div data-nav-icon-open="" class="w-embed"><svg width="18" height="10" viewBox="0 0 18 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
