</div></div></section><div data-anim="stars" class="stars-wrapper"><div class="home-slider-wrapper"><div class="home-slider-full"><div class="home-slider-inner"><div class="swiper home"><div class="swiper-wrapper home"><div class="home-slider swiper-slide"><div data-wf--typography-rich-text--variant="text-medium" class="text-rich-text-2 w-variant-767f4cc3-16ea-e863-eaac-63232a6faa64 w-richtext text-align-center text-slider"><p>Capture notes your way – <strong>bot or no bot</strong> – so you can stay focused on the meeting</p></div><div data-wf--spacer--variant="spacer-small" class="spacer"></div><div data-wf--image--variant="auto" class="image-wrapper w-variant-c878d500-2fb3-c4ce-d254-029af9591a9d home-slider-image"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6899da9beccbdbe92be49b5d/6a906aaede7376e9ec5c6b3d_69de69257342cfaefbbaa833_carousel-1%20(1).avif" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6899da9beccbdbe92be49b5d/6a906aaede7376e9ec5c6b3d_69de69257342cfaefbbaa833_carousel-1%20(1)-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6899da9beccbdbe92be49b5d/6a906aaede7376e9ec5c6b3d_69de69257342cfaefbbaa833_carousel-1%20(1)-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6899da9beccbdbe92be49b5d/6a906aaede7376e9ec5c6b3d_69de69257342cfaefbbaa833_carousel-1%20(1).avif 1000w" class="component-image w-variant-c878d500-2fb3-c4ce-d254-029af9591a9d"/></div></div><div class="home-slider swiper-slide"><div data-wf--typography-rich-text--variant="text-medium" class="text-rich-text-2 w-variant-767f4cc3-16ea-e863-eaac-63232a6faa64 w-richtext text-align-center text-slider"><p>AI summaries instantly <br/>available after your call</p></div><div data-wf--spacer--variant="spacer-small" class="spacer"></div><div data-wf--image--variant="auto" class="image-wrapper w-variant-c878d500-2fb3-c4ce-d254-029af9591a9d home-slider-image"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6899da9beccbdbe92be49b5d/6a906aada78e00c5b32a