text-2 w-variant-767f4cc3-16ea-e863-eaac-63232a6faa64 w-richtext text-align-center text-slider"><p>Automatically monitor key topics so <br/>you never miss critical moments</p></div><div data-wf--spacer--variant="spacer-small" class="spacer"></div><div data-wf--image--variant="auto" class="image-wrapper w-variant-c878d500-2fb3-c4ce-d254-029af9591a9d home-slider-image"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6899da9beccbdbe92be49b5d/6a906aad65aea1ac0ef96998_69de69257d2e8b183dfdb058_carousel-4%20(1).avif" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6899da9beccbdbe92be49b5d/6a906aad65aea1ac0ef96998_69de69257d2e8b183dfdb058_carousel-4%20(1)-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6899da9beccbdbe92be49b5d/6a906aad65aea1ac0ef96998_69de69257d2e8b183dfdb058_carousel-4%20(1)-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6899da9beccbdbe92be49b5d/6a906aad65aea1ac0ef96998_69de69257d2e8b183dfdb058_carousel-4%20(1).avif 1000w" class="component-image w-variant-c878d500-2fb3-c4ce-d254-029af9591a9d"/></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="align-center top-m"><div class="slider-navigation-wrapper is-home"><a href="#" class="swiper-prev is-yellow w-inline-block"><div class="arrow w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="display: block; width:100%; height: auto;" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none">
