</svg></div><p data-scramble="scroll" class="text-size-tiny sub w-variant-87982b26-75b8-4c92-26e1-5d86f29e6c99">Stronger relationships, better retention</p></div><p class="text-align-center _w-80">Fathom captures key moments, surfaces risks and opportunities, automates CRM updates and follow-ups, and spots trends across conversations — so your team can spend less time on admin and more time delivering value.</p></div><a data-tf-hidden-utm="" data-modal="False" data-wf--button--variant="purple" href="/solutions/customer-success" class="button grad w-variant-76333c55-58ff-b511-2501-e0d2d3b27683 w-inline-block"><p class="button-text w-variant-76333c55-58ff-b511-2501-e0d2d3b27683">SEE FATHOM FOR CS</p><div class="button-gradient color w-variant-76333c55-58ff-b511-2501-e0d2d3b27683"></div></a></div></div><div class="slide"><div class="slider_card"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6899da9beccbdbe92be49b5d/6a1db1d19b85709a2f783afa_Image%202%20(2).svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-slider"/><div class="slider_overlay"></div><div class="slider-content_wrapper"><h3 class="text-size-large text-align-center">Marketing </h3><div data-wf--sub-element--variant="pink" class="sub-element w-variant-87982b26-75b8-4c92-26e1-5d86f29e6c99"><div class="star w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 11 11">
